{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12080","headline":"玛瑙杯歌 · 钱起","name":"玛瑙杯歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瑶溪碧岸生奇宝，剖质披心出文藻。\n良工雕饰明且鲜，得成珍器入芳筵。\n含华炳丽金尊侧，翠斝琼觞忽无色。\n繁弦急管催献酬，倏若飞空生羽翼。\n𤩌𤩌兰英照豹斑，满堂词客尽朱\n花光来去传香袖，霞影高低傍玉山。\n王孙彩笔题新咏，碎锦连珠复辉映。\n世情贵耳不贵奇，谩说海底珊瑚枝。\n宁及琢磨当妙用，燕歌楚舞长相随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12080.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12080","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}